meta {
  name: Bulk reject
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/bills/bulk/reject
  body: json
  auth: none
}

body:json {
  {
    "ids": ["{{billId}}"],
    "notes": "Wrong period."
  }
}

docs {
  Admin or Approver. Rejects every supplied PENDING_APPROVAL bill; the
  optional `notes` string is applied uniformly to every Approval row.
  Per-item notes are out of scope — a bulk action with N distinct
  reasons defeats the point. Items not in PENDING_APPROVAL fail per
  item with BILL_INVALID_TRANSITION. Viewer -> 403.

  Response shape: `{ results: [{ id, ok, data? | error? }], summary }`.
  Always HTTP 200; empty / duplicate `ids` -> 400 BULK_INVALID_IDS.
  See `bills/bulk/approve.bru` for the full envelope.
}
